meta {
  name: Get All Petrovis
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/v1/petrovis?page=1&limit=10&search=john&sort=created_at&order=desc
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  ## Description
  Admin endpoint for listing all Petrovis registrations with pagination, search, and sorting capabilities. Returns a paginated list of registrations.

  ## Authentication
  - Bearer token required
  - Role: **Admin only**

  ## Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|---------|-------------|
  | page | integer | No | 1 | Page number for pagination |
  | limit | integer | No | 10 | Number of items per page |
  | search | string | No | - | Search by leader name |
  | sort | string | No | created_at | Field to sort by |
  | order | string | No | desc | Sort direction (asc or desc) |

  ## Response Structure
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "success to get list Petrovis",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "c58a8a69-56a9-4c35-8a5f-9e95eae8b7ee",
          "spe": "SPE UI SC",
          "email": "adidin@gmail.com",
          "leader": "Adidin bin ahmad",
          "status": "paid"
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "current_page": 1,
        "from": 1,
        "last_page": 5,
        "per_page": 10,
        "to": 10,
        "total": 50
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Response Fields
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | id | string(uuid) | Unique identifier of the Petrovis registration |
  | spe | string | Name of the SPE organization |
  | email | string | Registration contact email |
  | leader | string | Name of the first delegate (leader) |
  | status | string | Payment status (paid, pending, cancelled) |

  ## Error Responses
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|
  | 401 | Unauthorized (missing or invalid token) |
  | 403 | Forbidden (not an admin) |
  | 500 | Failed to get list Petrovis |

  ## Business Logic Notes
  - Search functionality filters by leader (first delegate) name
  - Default sorting is by created_at in descending order (newest first)
  - Returns summary information only - use Get by ID for full details including all delegates
  - Status values reflect Tripay transaction status
}
